@host = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### 0. Login (ejecutar primero)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "ana@gmail.com",
    "password": "ana123"
}

# Las demás peticiones usan {{login.response.body.access_token}}.
# El id de los ejemplos viene de {{crearCliente.response.body.id}}:
# ejecuta primero el POST "Guardar cliente" antes de mostrar/modificar/eliminar.

### Listar
GET {{host}}/clienteproveedor
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Listar con paginación y búsqueda
GET {{host}}/clienteproveedor?page=1&limit=5&search=Juan
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Guardar cliente
# @name crearCliente
POST {{host}}/clienteproveedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "tipo": "cliente",
    "razon_social": "Juan Pérez",
    "identificacion": "1234567",
    "direccion": "Av. Siempre Viva 742",
    "telefono": "77712345",
    "correo": "juan@mail.com"
}

### Guardar proveedor
POST {{host}}/clienteproveedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "tipo": "proveedor",
    "razon_social": "Distribuidora Andina S.A.",
    "identificacion": "99887766",
    "direccion": "Calle Comercio 100",
    "telefono": "22233344",
    "correo": "ventas@andina.com",
    "estado": true
}

### Guardar solo con campos obligatorios (estado = true por defecto)
POST {{host}}/clienteproveedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "tipo": "cliente",
    "razon_social": "Cliente mínimo"
}

### Error de validación (tipo inválido, correo inválido) -> 400
POST {{host}}/clienteproveedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "tipo": "otro",
    "razon_social": "",
    "correo": "no-es-correo"
}

### Error de validación (campo no permitido) -> 400
POST {{host}}/clienteproveedor
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "tipo": "cliente",
    "razon_social": "Cliente con campo extra",
    "campoInexistente": 1
}

### Mostrar
GET {{host}}/clienteproveedor/{{crearCliente.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Mostrar inexistente -> 404
GET {{host}}/clienteproveedor/9999
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Modificar
PATCH {{host}}/clienteproveedor/{{crearCliente.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "razon_social": "Juan Pérez Actualizado",
    "telefono": "70000000"
}

### Desactivar
PATCH {{host}}/clienteproveedor/{{crearCliente.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

{
    "estado": false
}

### Eliminar (409 si tiene notas asociadas, 200 si no)
DELETE {{host}}/clienteproveedor/{{crearCliente.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
